    "Separate held-Up screen test. Sample the active Copper list while paused. Validate both the live spark and all empty cells in columns 20 through 33 of the right-to-left track on character row 13 (source scanline 110). The four bitplanes must match the candidate glyph and the selected background. Count modular cell advances at the observed PAL field numbers. No claim of 50 unique images per second."
